  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/01/IMG_08681.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(10 fotos) Aquest divendres, a les 12 hores, amb un festival al Teatre M&ograve;naco, acabar&aacute; l&#39;Escoleta de Nadal organitzada per l&#39;&agrave;rea d&#39;Educaci&oacute; d&#39;Onda i gestionada per M&oacute;n d&#39;Animaci&oacute;, en la qual han participat un centenar de xiquets i xiquetes des del 24 de desembre.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/escoletanadalonda1819/img_0868.jpg\" alt=\"img_0868\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/escoletanadalonda1819/img_0869.jpg\" alt=\"img_0869\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/escoletanadalonda1819/img_0870.jpg\" alt=\"img_0870\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/escoletanadalonda1819/img_0871.jpg\" alt=\"img_0871\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/escoletanadalonda1819/img_0873.jpg\" alt=\"img_0873\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/escoletanadalonda1819/img_0875.jpg\" alt=\"img_0875\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/escoletanadalonda1819/img_0876.jpg\" alt=\"img_0876\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/escoletanadalonda1819/img_0877.jpg\" alt=\"img_0877\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/escoletanadalonda1819/img_0878.jpg\" alt=\"img_0878\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img